<%# The theme 404 (spec §6.4): PagesController renders this, at :not_found
    status, for any path PublicSite::Resolver couldn't match to a record or a
    redirect. @page and @post are both nil here, so the layout's hreflang
    block and this page's own header render nothing that assumes either. %>
<header class="mb-12">
  <h1 class="mt-3 font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-h1">Page not found</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-dim">
    The page you're looking for doesn't exist, or isn't here any more.
  </p>
</header>
<%= link_to "Back to the homepage", home_url_path, class: "text-accent underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent-hover" %>
